{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的扫读负担明显大于Y，尤其S05只有18秒，却同时出现大量未经分时处理的感受词，容易来不及消化；Y的左右分栏更容易快速定位。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X整体更胜一筹，因为加亮词能直接标出每段心理转折，而且保留了Y压缩掉的一些重要因果和矛盾，尤其是S06、S07、S11、S13中既想亲近又害怕失去的复杂心理。X的音乐感受也更有层次，具体到声线、音色、力度、旋律走向和身体感受，分时出现的设计能让这些细节与音乐进程形成对应。Y确实更容易扫读，但部分心理变化被简化，前后递进的细腻程度和人物内心的完整性有所损失。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c370ce7e-7a22-4cda-be5f-cc1758f0b885", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T154434774036Z", "elapsed_seconds": 131.468, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:46:46.262399+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5049307de9b9e79558831ccf6b5e0ae4c54a9f4760fb5a8da69fac3e626cc39a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat